SUMMARY:All Jammed Up Fest - Sunday Schedule
DESCRIPTION:Tickets from $30.00 click here! \nAll Jammed Up Fest is back and bigger than before with two stages\, fifteen different acts\, yoga before the music begins both days\, tie-dye workshops\, glass blowing workshops\, and vendors – there is sure to be something for everyone! \nWith nationally touring bands like Kendall Street Company\, Frute\, Fireside Collective Trio and Sicard Hollow. As well as staples of the Asheville music scene like Suns of Stars\, Shed Bugs\, and Strictly Liquid. A good time is a guarantee! Bring your dancing shoes\, your best friend\, and let’s celebrate the joy that is live music in the summer time. \nFood trucks will be available on site both days. One World Brewing has a full bar. No outside alcohol will be permitted in the venue. \nPresented by All Jammed Up\, this special two-night party celebrates community and the joy of live music. Come kick your shoes off\, dance your heart out\, and support local artists and vendors! You’re not gonna want to miss it!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/all-jammed-up-fest-sunday-schedule/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
