SUMMARY:Reggae Sunday w/ CHALWA
DESCRIPTION:This 8-member Mountain Reggae powerhouse packs it full of roots meditations and high grade jams that awaken your spirit and soul! Chalwa’s high energy shows are one of a kind\, featuring smooth vocals\, percussion\, bass\, lead guitar\, keys and saxophone. Their extensive collection of original music is interlaced with music from some of the Greats including\, Bob Marley\, Peter Tosh\, Burning Spear\, Bunny Wailer and even Jerry Garcia and the Grateful Dead. \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/chalwa-returns-2-2-2/2026-07-19/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-12-20-214144-e1766285002169.png
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
